Clone of the Toy Battle board game. 
Code is partly based on the card game from the Youtube video series by Barry's Dev Hell (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2jMcuKdRh2w&list=PLNWIwxsLZ-LMYzxHlVb7v5Xo5KaUV7Tq1)

Building:
open the project in Godot 4.6.3. Install the WebRTC extension and the 'Tube' addon and create a TubeContext for the TubeClient node in the Main.tscn scene.

My changes to Barry's code are licensed under CC0. Do whatever you want with it. Have fun :D
